-- A call script for examples/twin.lang (S10 s3, D4): side 1 (remote) of the differential
-- of two deployments in one chain state (test/diff.sh part 3). Enact the Decision word of
-- test/run/twin-d4-home.script, accept the batch of its seal, then claim from that batch.
init 1u
1 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000aa sideOf

-- Enact with attest A (row 2 of test/run/twin-remote.script). Then rxOf and ryOf equal
-- the reserves of the home side.
